ent between receipts and expenditures.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_55fe622d13384b54b759e3bd","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Explore available treasury bulletin resources\n- [x] Extract Net Receipts and Expenditures data for fiscal years 1948-1964\n- [x] Find GBP/USD exchange rates for each year (1948-1964)\n- [ ] Convert all figures from USD to GBP\n- [ ] Calculate Pearson correlation coefficient\n- [ ] Write final answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
